{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1000_p", "source_sha256": "16d577eef8e307ce8a0256a39bdd096a05ad95e395f701a7c80e1b99d8db0109", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影日。\n雪歩のテーマは『紅茶好きの悪魔』だった）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志联动企划的日子。\n雪步的主题是『喜欢红茶的恶魔』）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5c93acfda93926d2129f862f9cddb4c28a07b1be3d3a687af19d3c0fd1480d33", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまですぅ。\n紅茶を淹れましたので、よければあちらへどうぞ～。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n我泡好了红茶，如果不介意的话，请到那边来吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ee6bfa068fe77b5e32d28f949e5d21f22b821ad812b487892d2dc0a172c78af0", "ja": "お、ありがとう。\n紅茶か。今回の撮影の設定どおりだな。", "zh": "哦，谢谢。\n是红茶啊。和这次拍摄的设定一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "61eadcc056ffcbb2c9ffd70bf028f7579ecb7fde5bb209bc7c3dd0d73158f00a", "ja": "はい。『紅茶好きの悪魔』ですから♪　せっかくなので\nスタジオの皆さんにも飲んでもらってるんです。", "zh": "是的。因为我是“喜欢红茶的恶魔”嘛♪ 难得有这个机会，  \n也让摄影棚的大家都喝了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c80716b82879301afb482e2317da2acfd8e68413784b84ea17b4a89787d38ee1", "ja": "ちょっとだけ変わった色の紅茶ですけど……\n変なものは入っていませんから、安心してくださいね。", "zh": "这是颜色稍微有点特别的红茶……\n里面没有放奇怪的东西，请放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d52ef7550dd0996b419c424cebd732ed97a96122dd942a0d08709f8e05723f07", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nそういわれると逆に怖い気もしてきちゃうな。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……\n你这么一说，反倒让我觉得有点可怕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1007_p", "source_sha256": "65b71e8ce7d0e48ecf1db4b414105525d2e414b85adefa79e8d0254ac27b24cc", "ja": "いや、ははは。飲んだ人間を意のままに操る、\n悪魔の紅茶って設定だったから。ごめんごめん。", "zh": "没有啦，哈哈。因为设定是喝下的人就会被随意操纵的恶魔红茶。抱歉抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8c6e11647d8ef896cb3079bf6e2e98d3c33abb9f8ffc30239a78733d728caee2", "ja": "ふふふ、そうですね。\n悪魔って本当に怖いことをしますよね……。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。恶魔真的会做出很可怕的事情呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bcafbae491a489afc37cdf0871e46fb29e1128a8c95d7c5dd0a4fbd4b9eddc30", "ja": "わ、私だったら……怖くてそんな紅茶を\n誰かに飲ませるなんて、できないと思います……。", "zh": "要是换作我……肯定会害怕得\n没法把那种红茶端给别人喝的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8b6fa41fb8fe151eb677fd9067467073afd9a5af62605c2c9e320b58850e5817", "ja": "あうっ。でも、それじゃダメダメですよね。\n私なんか、いくじなしのポンコツよわよわ悪魔ですぅ。", "zh": "啊呜……可是，那样可不行呢。像我这种人，只是个没出息、不中用、弱不禁风的小恶魔啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1011_p", "source_sha256": "756d4d43a0beae475be67f9afd4289d71151089396cb7cb3fafb1f2c3b58aa27", "ja": "ははっ、雪歩が積極的に悪いことをできている\nイメージは、たしかにわかないかもしれないな。", "zh": "哈哈，确实很难想象雪步能积极主动地做坏事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "330509a215e7f84875434298aa13af421db6f45a762ebde20001589252cf4ee9", "ja": "そうですよね……。\nで、でもそれじゃ{$P$}。", "zh": "是啊……。\n可、可是那样的话，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bb0005c03e7808f1251898163bacd5fa033d5bd3951bd00ff82e29b9bc7f6939", "ja": "どうして私は今回、他の衣装じゃなくて、\n悪魔の衣装での撮影だったんですか？", "zh": "为什么这次不是拍摄其他服装，\n而是拍摄恶魔服装的造型呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1014_p", "source_sha256": "242b6bcb69ec5959f563a7316648d78a3595f9a326debd8897172315b5c95f23", "ja": "あぁ、それなら簡単だ。\n雪歩なら、ギャップによる怖さを出せると思ってな。", "zh": "啊，那很简单。因为如果是雪步，我觉得能展现出反差带来的恐怖感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9ea084259e2c692408b32b18d71c4c682e6b2eae4f377cf500a8bd2aa377f3fe", "ja": "ぎゃ、ギャップですか？", "zh": "啊，反差吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1016_p", "source_sha256": "98bbc01d7b3375c43c35beadce24bc219c38fda2bf5b8dc154e8f31d25c97046", "ja": "うん。たとえば、見た目が怖い犬が吠えてくるより。\n普段はおとなしい犬が急に吠えてくるほうが怖いだろ？", "zh": "嗯。比如说，比起外表吓人的狗冲着你叫，\n平时很温顺的狗突然叫起来更吓人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1017_p", "source_sha256": "48919768d99a530842ee428b7944e2be539e2df01c7a6202fae951ebe86b99f2", "ja": "そういう風に、一見すると優しそうな雪歩が、実は\n怖かった！　っていうギャップの魅力を狙ったんだ。", "zh": "就是这样，我是想利用雪步乍看之下很温柔，实际上却很可怕！这种反差的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bcde5d166329edb61bf7bc4377a63cb4f50451237d9eca48e8534ce219fad12b", "ja": "なるほどぉ。そうなんですかぁ……。で、でも\nお言葉ですが、{$P$}。あの……。", "zh": "原来如此。是这样啊……不过，恕我直言，{$P$}。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0603_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "685375deb8d1a920c53845f820f7c950b4411fde06cf14fca2c53911ebb6469a", "ja": "おとなしい子でも、見た目が怖い子でも、\n吠えたら犬は、どっちもぜったい怖いですよぉ～！", "zh": "不管是性格温顺的狗狗，还是看起来很吓人的狗狗，只要一叫，狗狗都绝对很可怕哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
